{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wizard girl arrives at an abandoned site full of mysterious blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the girl who can destroy the block to the gate of the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to an action puzzle game. You can eliminate blocks to reach the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer more than 50 different stages to help the girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1: The game is easy and not too difficult. There is also a tip function to enjoy the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2: There is a story and a report to learn the main character girl and this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3: As the stage progresses, you will see various gimmicks. You will not get bored of conquering the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can't see the entire screen in full screen, please play in a windowed screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also a free trial version, so please try playing that first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to upload videos and distribution regardless of monetization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate if you could put the name of the game and the site URL in the title of your video or distribution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*This game does not use any AI illustrations.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tutorial Clear!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3358410/62c2728ceda7ddcb6d13749b006baa48576844dd.jpg"},{"name":"Stage10 Clear!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3358410/aa211f99cb4ba08cf4559658bb03d97381d04a3a.jpg"},{"name":"Stage20 Clear!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3358410/da5c79dd1c078f3db